# Next.js 16 + Strapi Project
## 📺 Tutorial Source

This project is based on the YouTube tutorial: [Next.js 16 + Strapi 5 Tutorial](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VosHdPQr6nI)

A modern web application built with Next.js 16 and Strapi CMS.

## Features

- **Next.js 16**: Latest React framework with App Router
- **Strapi CMS**: Headless content management system
- **TypeScript**: Type-safe development
- **Responsive Design**: Mobile-first approach

## Getting Started

### Prerequisites

- Node.js 18+ 
- npm or yarn
- PostgreSQL/MySQL (for Strapi)

### Installation

1. Clone the repository